### Flujo de prueba (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client). App en docker compose: puerto 8080.
@base = http://localhost:8080
@account = ACC-001

### 1. Crear limites MOBILE: diario 1000.00, por operacion 300.00 (AC-12)
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account}}/limits/MOBILE
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dailyLimit": 1000.00, "perOperationLimit": 300.00 }

### 2. Consultar limites (AC-15)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account}}/limits

### 3. Transferencia aprobada: 200 (AC-01)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account}}/transfer-validations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "channel": "MOBILE", "amount": 250.50 }

### 4. Rechazada por limite por operacion: 422 problem+json (AC-04)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account}}/transfer-validations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "channel": "MOBILE", "amount": 301.00 }

### 5. Rechazada por acumulado: consume 300 + 300 y luego pide 300 (AC-05)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account}}/transfer-validations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "channel": "MOBILE", "amount": 300.00 }

###
POST {{base}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account}}/transfer-validations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "channel": "MOBILE", "amount": 300.00 }

###
POST {{base}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account}}/transfer-validations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "channel": "MOBILE", "amount": 300.00 }

### 6. Cuenta inexistente: 404 problem+json con traceId (AC-10)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/accounts/ACC-NO-EXISTE/limits

### 7. Salud
GET {{base}}/actuator/health
